  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta L = \\text{l} \\Delta  ω = \\frac{1}{2} \\times  1.8 \\times  {0.15}^{2}   ( 9.0 - 4.0 )\"></span>  ✓  <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.10\"></span> «N m s»  ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>Average torque <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"= \\frac{\\Delta L}{\\Delta t} = \\frac{0.10}{0.24} = 0.42\"></span> «N m» ✓ Average force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"=\\frac{τ}{R}=\\frac{0.42}{0.15}=2.8\"></span> «N» ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>No other forces than F provide the torque ✓ The thread unwinds without slipping ✓ The thread is weightless ✓ F is always tangent to the flywheel ✓</p></section>"
